Fudan University Thesis (fduthesis) (typage/fduthesis) - license

This template contains files from two sources.

  main.tex, refs.bib, manifest.json, typage.json, LICENSE
      Written by 7D24H. CC0-1.0: dedicated to the public domain; documents
      written from this template need no attribution.
      https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

  fduthesis.cls, fduthesis.def, fduthesis-en.cls, fudan-name.pdf,
  fudan-emblem.pdf, fudan-emblem-new.pdf
      fduthesis 0.9a (2023-05-27), the Fudan University thesis template,
      Copyright 2017-2023 Xiangdong Zeng, under the LaTeX Project Public
      License 1.3c, as stated in the file headers and the project README
      (https://github.com/stone-zeng/fduthesis). As distributed by CTAN
      (https://mirrors.ctan.org/install/macros/latex/contrib/fduthesis.tds.zip, identical to the fduthesis.tds.zip of
      the v0.9a GitHub release). Redistributed unmodified, so that the
      template compiles offline. The logo files show the emblem and name of
      Fudan University, for theses of that university.

The fonts (Fandol, XITS) and the other packages, among them gbt7714 for the
reference list, come from the built-in Tectonic bundle under their own
licenses. Check the current requirements of Fudan University before
submitting.
